{
	"name": "Champion of Legend",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/skills/melee/sword-winged-holy-orange.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 20th level, you have become a legend among those who whisper your name in reverent tones and hushed halls or shout it from parapets and street corners in breathless cheers.</p><p>If you are reduced to 0 HP while you have @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.kdy4n7MRzAVYykI4]{Rise to the Challenge} active, you do not fall unconscious; though you do begin dying and must make death saving throws normally.</p><p>If you are reduced to 0 HP while within reach of completing your current quest, you may instead choose to become Doomed and continue acting toward that goal. Your HP total increases to 1/2 of your normal maximum, leaving you bloodied. Should you be reduced to 0 HP again before achieving your goal you will die permanently when the Doomed condition ends, and no magic can resurrect you.</p>",
